# ── Virtual environments ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/site-packages/

# ── Python caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ── Model weights & normalisation stats ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Multiple GB across ~8,600 files and fully regenerable from the training scripts. Git is
# the wrong tool for these. The one exception is force-added below: the behaviour-cloned
# controller in model_data/BEST_bc_clone_D2_validated, which is the project's recommended
# deliverable and the only artefact that passes held-out D2 validation.
**/recurrent_checkpoints*/
**/tdmpc2_checkpoints/
**/varmpc_checkpoints/
**/best_det_checkpoint/
**/contaminated_v16_dual_process/
*.zip
*.pkl
*.backup_*

# Per-run training logs copied into each archive directory alongside its checkpoint. Multi-MB
# each and dominated by per-step [EnvDebug] output; the findings are summarised in
# PPO_IBM/finalresults.md, which is tracked.
PPO_IBM/model_data/archive_*/*.log

# ── TensorBoard event files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/ppo_recurrent_tensorboard/
**/rsac_tensorboard/
**/sac_tensorboard/
**/ppo_pbr_tensorboard/
**/events.out.tfevents.*

# ── Bulk run logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Individual training logs are multi-MB (mostly per-step [EnvDebug] output) and are already
# copied into each run's model_data/archive_*/ directory alongside its checkpoint. The
# per-run config snapshots (logs/config_*.json) ARE tracked — they are small and are the
# record of what each run actually ran with.
PPO_IBM/logs/*.log
PPO_IBM/logs/scratch/
PPO_IBM/logs/validation/

# ── Third-party dataset dumps ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__MACOSX/
**/PBR_Simulation_Dataset/

# ── Generated knowledge graph ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
graphify-out/

# ── OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini

# ── Local agent config ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/

# ── Generated images ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.ico
